{"badger":"share/v1","app_version":"1.1.11","created_at":"2026-09-13T05:09:28.643682Z","type":"routine","payload":{"routine":{"name":"Madcow 5×5","notes":"3 days/week. Every set is a percentage of that lift's top set, and the top set moves once a week: Friday's heavy triple sets the weight Monday ramps to (the press and the deadlift are trained on Wednesday, so Wednesday moves those). Until a lift has a top set here there is no percentage to work from, so the first session shows your last logged weights (tagged \"prev\") if you have any, and nothing at all if you do not - type what you lift and every session after that fills itself in.","weight_source":"last_performance","history_scope":"any_workout"},"days":[{"name":"Monday - Medium","scheduled_days":[1],"exercises":[{"exercise_name":"Barbell Back Squat","exercise_type":"weight_reps","progression_group_key":"mc-200","predefined_sets":[{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":50.0},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":62.5},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":75.0},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":87.5},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":100.0}]},{"exercise_name":"Flat Barbell Bench Press","exercise_type":"weight_reps","progression_group_key":"mc-1","predefined_sets":[{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":50.0},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":62.5},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":75.0},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":87.5},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":100.0}]},{"exercise_name":"Barbell Row","exercise_type":"weight_reps","progression_group_key":"mc-45","predefined_sets":[{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":50.0},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":62.5},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":75.0},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":87.5},{"is_warmup":false,"reps":5,"percent_of_reference":100.0}]}]}